">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/kg4Skqv63u92\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n<h5 class=\"section-title guide\">Paella</h5>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\n7 Portes\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\nPasseig Isabel II, 14, 08003 Barcelona, Spain\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=t&amp;rct=j&amp;url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.7portes.com%2F&amp;source=maps&amp;cd=1&amp;usg=AFQjCNEDmmuLIoYAakT48vukQYYB9UoxUQ&amp;ved=1t%3A3443%2Cp%3A0TFsV6HKEYrxmAHHk4voCg\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/LVWdJKWVqC92\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nArrosseria Xàtiva\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\nCarrer del Torrent d'En Vidalet, 26, 08012 Barcelona, Spain\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=t&amp;rct=j&amp;q=&amp;esrc=s&amp;source=web&amp;cd=12&amp;cad=rja&amp;uact=8&amp;ved=0ahUKEwjGsJXH7b7NAhUDziYKHWCFBVkQ_BcIhwEwCw&amp;url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.grupxativa.com%2F&amp;usg=AFQjCNE5WWR_cnZf9PFBkx4H6lhBuam9-Q&amp;bvm=bv.125221236,d.eWE\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/WRiqKAzf9AS2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nEl Suquet de l'Almirall\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\nPasseig de Joan de Borbó, 65, 08003 Barcelona, Spain\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://www.suquetdelalmirall.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/Wr2LUEdr8u62\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nCan Solé\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\nc/San Carles, 4 - Barcelona\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://www.cansole.cat/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/uxGzXRQX8TE2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n<h5 class=\"section-title guide\" id=\"drinks\">Drinks</h5>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"featured-guide-row\">\n<div class=\"featured\">\n<div class=\"image-wrapper\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/summit-landing-archive/44524f285b3a/solange.jpg\" />\n</div>\n<div class=\"featured-content\">\n<h5>Solange</h5>\n<div class=\"address\">\nCarrer Aribau, 143,<br />08036 Barcelona, Spain\n</div>\n<p>\nThe place James Bond would drink if he came to Barcelona (in fact it was named after Solange Dimitrios, one of 007's love interests in Casino Royale). It attracts a smart crowd who sit at the long wooden bar and the Martinis, of course, are perfect.'\n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"http://www.solangecocktail.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/TLDX2ruiayn\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"featured\">\n<div class=\"image-wrapper\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/summit-landing-archive/a23ea9279544/gatsby.jpg\" />\n</div>\n<div class=\"featured-content\">\n<h5>Gatsby</h5>\n<div class=\"address\">\nCarrer Tusset, 19-21\n</div>\n<p>\nEnjoy an attractive menu that merges high contemporary cuisine with Spanish classics while enjoying delicious cocktails and a fantastic show based on the '20s.\n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"http://www.gatsbybarcelona.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/LhjnX1Sh3y92\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"featured\">\n<div class=\"image-wrapper\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/summit-landing-archive/ddb1392a628f/emilia.jpg\" />\n</div>\n<div class=\"featured-content\">\n<h5>Hotel Villa Emilia</h5>\n<div class=\"address\">\nCarrer de Calàbria, 115,<br />08015 Barcelona, Spain\n</div>\n<p>\nCheck out The Zinc Bar on the rooftop, and enjoy live piano music Thursday through Sunday after 7:30pm.\n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"http://www.hotelvillaemilia.com/en/zinc-bar/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/K8UV351ay7N2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nTorre Rosa\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\nCarrer de Francesc Tàrrega, 22, 08027 Barcelona, Spain\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://www.torrerosa.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/YGyohi44aen\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nSlow\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\nCarrer de París, 186, 08036 Barcelona, Spain\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://www.slowbarcelona.es/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/A1KvkyhLW1R2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nMorro Fi\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\nCarrer del Consell de Cent, 171, 08015 Barcelona, Spain\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://www.morrofi.cat/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/eqY7v8Fd2SL2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nIdeal Cocktail Bar\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\nCarrer d'Aribau, 89, 08036 Barcelona, Spain\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://idealcocktailbar.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/SXp6yoASQCt\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nMonvínic\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\nCarrer de la Diputació, 249, 08007 Barcelona, Spain\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://www.monvinic.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/zEY2sKFyYww\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nSenyor Vermout\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\nCarrer Provença, 85\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/senyorvermut/info/?entry_point=page_nav_about_item&amp;tab=overview\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/iEjjekpH2pL2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nUra\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\nDiagonal, 477\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://www.urabcn.com/#es/about-us\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/etEoSqeYgiS2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nBoca Grande\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\nPassatge de la Concepció, 12\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://www.bocagrande.cat/en/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/w4y2mb9ipb82\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n<h5 class=\"section-title guide\" id=\"active\">Sights, Activites &amp; Culture</h5>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"featured-guide-row\">\n<div class=\"featured\">\n<div class=\"image-wrapper\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/summit-landing-archive/008ef53d532b/sagrada.jpg\" />\n</div>\n<div class=\"featured-content\">\n<h5>Sagrada Família</h5>\n<div class=\"address\">\nCarrer de Mallorca, 401,<br />08013 Barcelona, Spain\n</div>\n<p>\nSee architect Antoni Gaudí's masterpiece, the Sagrada Família set for completion in 2026 after 150 years of construction. It is advised to <a href=\"http://www.sagradafamilia.org/en/tickets/\" target=\"_blank\">purchase tickets in advance</a>.\n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"http://www.sagradafamilia.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/yUa88MyAhUE2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"featured\">\n<div class=\"image-wrapper\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/summit-landing-archive/9693f8e4f670/boqueria.jpg\" />\n</div>\n<div class=\"featured-content\">\n<h5>La Boqueria</h5>\n<div class=\"address\">\nLes Rambles, 91,<br />08001 Barcelona, Spain\n</div>\n<p>\nSit down and eat or pick out some fresh fruits and vegetables at Barcelona’s best market!\n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"http://www.boqueria.info/index.php?lang=en\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/dt9vsWALpxF2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"featured\">\n<div class=\"image-wrapper\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/summit-landing-archive/f69ae2e9c36d/supercomputing.jpg\" />\n</div>\n<div class=\"featured-content\">\n<h5>Park Güell</h5>\n<div class=\"address\">\n08024 Barcelona, Spain\n</div>\n<p>\nVisit this beautiful architectural park designed by Antoni Gaudi that has appeared in many movies and is characterized by colorful mosaic tiles and whimsical structures. <a href=\"http://www.parkguell.cat/compra-dentrades/\" target=\"_blank\">Tickets can be purchased online in advance.</a>\n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"http://www.parkguell.cat/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/rX6HEUk9Thr\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nMercat de Santa Caterina\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\nAv. de Francesc Cambó, 16, 08003 Barcelona, Spain\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://www.mercatsantacaterina.com/Index.php\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/DsB76MVBtMG2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>